# issue-flow — iflow smart dispatcher (`/iflow`)

Run **the right next step**: detect state and route to `/iflow-pick <N>` (capture), `/iflow-plan`, `/iflow-build`, or `/iflow-close`, forwarding trailing args verbatim. Every other command runs only when the user types it.

